{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Also</b> — to include beyond his reproach that he is a fool, meaning: because the rational soul has no knowledge to turn back from the ways of crookedness, he is not good." "<b>and hastens</b> — that he runs to rob, he is a sinner."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:34.164258217Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}